==Unlocking==
This Mount ''cannot'' be obtained through [[Items#Crafting|Item Crafting]].

It is unlocked by performing [[Expeditions]] and winning encounters, and progress is only counted when the Mount slot is unlocked ([[Paragon]] 26 or 1e380 [[Mysteries]]).

The amount of progress each winning Expedition encounter is affected by Monster Level and Wizard's Expedition Level. Progress is determined as follows:
<pre>
({Monster Level} / {Wizard's Expedition Level} * 0.2)% per winning encounter.

Winning encounter's progress only counts if {Monster Level} is greater than or equal to {Wizard's Expedition Level - 10}

Unlocks when the sum is 100%
</pre>

